# Data Sharing & Consent Management Model

Consent is the foundation of trusted health data exchange.

## Consent Principles
- Patient-centric
- Purpose-specific
- Time-bound
- Revocable

## Practical Hospital Implementation
- Capture consent during registration
- Integrate consent with EMR workflows
- Log consent events
- Enable audit and reporting

## Key Challenge
Balancing clinical urgency with patient consent requirements.
